MOD: a lens module needs surfaces Sk and Sk+1 between the object and the image (Sk from 1 to 1)
MOD: a lens module needs surfaces Sk and Sk+1 between the object and the image (Sk from 1 to 1)
MFL: S3 is not a lens module (MOD S3 first)
MFL: the focal length must not be 0
MED: the entrance pupil diameter must be positive
MRD: only an object at infinity (MRD 0) is supported so far
MFD: OBJ (object height) needs a finite object, which lens modules do not support yet
MCO: C27 (pupil spherical aberration) is not supported yet
MCO: coefficients are C1-C3, C6-C8 (colour) and C11-C15
MCO: 'X' is not a number
MOD: CHR/ACH lens modules are not supported yet; use MWL and MCO C1-C8 for colour
